Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: translate the wireless trade select screen (overlay
 65)

Run 57: two consoles linked in the Union Room and talked; choosing TRADE aborted on [SS-MISSING] WirelessTradeSelectMon_Init.
Seed WirelessTradeSelectMon_Init/Main/Exit and the whole overlay_65.s (its pointer tables) into the maploader translator, drop
their Missing() lines, and have ss3ds_game.sh re-sync the staged seed-files.json too.
